I think you've missed the point a little bit. You see, the
point is to keep you from doing things that you don't actually
*want* to do, but that just kinda happen anyway. It's not
intended to tell the player that walking into floating eyes could
be rather unhealthy, everyone already knows that. It's to make
sure you don't have to be ultra hyper concentrated for every
move you make. I, for one, play this game to relax, and as it
is a computer game, i think the computer should do the dirty
work (such as paying attention :-), not me.

